ote=f76c99f69499336d\" title=\"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma\">67-thm-fixed-point-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"824fdc45d800b7dd\" href=\"?note=824fdc45d800b7dd\" title=\"67-df-robinson-arithmetic\">67-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64b63d5b2d39752e\" href=\"?note=64b63d5b2d39752e\" title=\"67-lem-recursive-predicate-representability\">67-lem-recursive-predicate-representability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 2; Lemma 2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"17"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"28"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述已核对；未独立完成全部基础事实或原书证明的形式验证"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 为 Robinson 算术，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"824fdc45d800b7dd\" href=\"?note=824fdc45d800b7dd\" title=\"67-df-robinson-arithmetic\">67-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EssUndec}\">\\(\\mathrm{EssUndec}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b488bd715fda08a1\" href=\"?note=b488bd715fda08a1\" title=\"67-df-essentially-undecidable\">67-df-essentially-undecidable</a>。</li>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的编号与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f76c99f69499336d\" href=\"?note=f76c99f69499336d\" title=\"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma\">67-thm-fixed-point-lemma</a> 的固定点接口；递归集合在 Q 中逐数双表示取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"64b63d5b2d39752e\" href=\"?note=64b63d5b2d39752e\" title=\"67-lem-recursive-predicate-representability\">67-lem-recursive-predicate-representability</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EssUndec}(Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EssUndec}(Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 1.2 及 Lemma 1.2, p.17。若一致扩张 U 的定理集合递归，存在在 Q（因而在 U）中逐数双表示该集合的 τ(x)。固定点给出 Q⊢θ↔¬τ(⌜θ⌝)。若 U⊢θ，双表示给出 U⊢τ(⌜θ⌝)，矛盾；若 U 不证 θ，双表示给出 U⊢¬τ(⌜θ⌝)，继而 U⊢θ，仍矛盾。因此无可判定的一致扩张。原书基础的递归函数表示事实未在本册重新完全构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-essentially-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"b488bd715fda08a1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-essentially-undecidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f76c99f69499336d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"824fdc45d800b7dd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-4","tar